{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-10-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'WILDEN RELEASES NEW 76 MM METAL EQUALIZER SURGE DAMPENER - INTEGRATED SD SERIES', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , OCT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WILDEN, PART OF PSG, A DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) COMPANY, AND A WORLDWIDE LEADER IN SPECIALTY PUMPS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS EXPANDED ITS LINE OF METAL EQUALIZER® SURGE DAMPENERS – INTEGRATED SD SERIES (ISD) WITH THE ADDITION OF A NEW 76 MM (3") MODEL.'}